DESCRIPTION:Village Dance is a somatic journey through music and movement. We strive to co-create an inclusive space for everybody. We start with an opening embodiment workshop\, followed by a DJ led dance journey\, and close with a sound journey with live instrumentation. More at @villagedancedavis
